{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-10-22 22:30:00', 'title': 'ASTERA LABS ACCELERATES PCI EXPRESS 5.0 SYSTEM DEPLOYMENT IN COLLABORATION WITH INTEL AND SYNOPSYS', 'text': "ASTERA LABS INC., IN COLLABORATION WITH SYNOPSYS, INC., AND INTEL, ANNOUNCED DEMONSTRATION OF A COMPLETE PCI EXPRESS® (PCIE®) 5.0 SYSTEM, DELIVERING 32 GT/S SPEEDS FOR NEXT-GENERATION SERVER WORKLOADS. THE END-TO-END SOLUTION SHOWCASES SYSTEM-LEVEL MULTI-VENDOR INTEROPERABILITY BETWEEN INTEL'S PCIE 5.0 TEST CHIP, SYNOPSYS' SILICON-PROVEN DESIGNWARE® CONTROLLER AND PHY IP FOR PCIE 5.0, AND ASTERA LABS' SMART RETIMER SOC FOR PCIE 5.0. THE JOINT PCIE 5.0 DEMONSTRATION WILL BE SHOWCASED IN THE SYNOPSYS BOOTH AT PCI-SIG DEVCON TAIPEI, OCTOBER 28-29 AT THE TAIPEI MARRIOTT HOTEL."}